<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 12.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, SEPT 12.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     Sept 12     Sept 11	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  240.690     240.550     237,040    1.54 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  301.500     301.250     303.640   -0.70 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  159.330     159.085     165.490   -3.72 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.660	46.588	48.410   -3.61 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  374.560     374.240     366.280    2.26 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  142.135     141.945     147.886   -3.89 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.789	15.790	14.975    5.44 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  218.890     218.110     230.135   -4.89 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.887	 1.886	 1.939   -2.68 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.556	 1.555	 1.575   -1.21 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  195.030     194.700     206.030   -5.34 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
